<!DOCTYPE suzuki [
<!ENTITY % sdatacharaents SYSTEM "..\config8\sdatacharaents.txt">
%sdatacharaents;
]>
<suzuki><manual>
<section sectnbr = "1D">
<servcat sctnbr = "01" scnbr = "04">
<configtype typenbr = "2">
<servinfotype sitcode = "6">
<servinfo servinfosgmlid = "AENLSB0A1426008" svcinfotypenbr = "08" svcinfoqualnbr = "01" page = "2" supplyoff = "1" modify = "0">
<title>
Vacuum Pump Removal and Installation
</title>
<attention4>
<ptxt>
The vacuum pump will lose its original performance if it is disassembled.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
Do not disassemble and repair the vacuum pump. If any faulty condition is found, replace the vacuum pump with a new one.
</ptxt>
</attention4>
<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0A1426008001">
<title>
Removal
</title>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Disconnect vacuum hose (1) and waste gate control hose No.4 (2) from vacuum pump.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove vacuum pump (3) with O-ring.
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "ILSB0A142010.jpg" width = "88.000mm" height = "53.159mm" ver = "01" gw = "185" gh = "134"/>
</figure>
</s1>
</servinfosub>
<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0A1426008002">
<title>
Installation
</title>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Clean mating surfaces of thermostat case and vacuum pump.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Install new O-ring (1) to vacuum pump.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Install vacuum pump (2) to thermostat case (3) aligning vacuum pump coupling (4) with slit (5) of camshaft.
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "ILSB0A142011.jpg" width = "88.000mm" height = "52.567mm" ver = "01" gw = "185" gh = "132"/>
</figure>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Tighten vacuum pump bolts (1) to specified torque.
</ptxt>
<torque>
<torqueitem id = "T1D239">
<t-part>
Vacuum pump bolt
</t-part>
<t-part1>
a
</t-part1>
<t-value1>
25
</t-value1>
<t-value2>
2.5
</t-value2>
<t-value3>
18.5
</t-value3>
</torqueitem>
</torque>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Connect waste gate control hose No.4 (2) and vacuum hose (3).
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "ILSB0A142012.jpg" width = "88.000mm" height = "53.159mm" ver = "01" gw = "185" gh = "134"/>
</figure>
</s1>
</servinfosub>
</servinfo>
</servinfotype>
</configtype>
</servcat>
</section></manual></suzuki>
